cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "variational-poroelasticity: code for A variational model of nonlinear poroelasticity"
abstract: >-
  Two-field finite-element solver and experiment drivers reproducing the numerical
  results of "A variational model of nonlinear poroelasticity": manufactured-solution
  convergence in the model's energy norms, the discrete energy-law defect on a sealed
  blob, and footing consolidation across three lateral-boundary treatments and three
  fluid-compressibility exponents.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
